.TH start-cli-server-registries 1  "registries "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-server\-registries \- Manage the registries this server\*(Aqs Marketplace is connected to
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli server registries\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage the registries this server\*(Aqs Marketplace is connected to
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
start\-cli\-server\-registries\-add(1)
Connect a registry, trusting the keys it offers for packages
.TP
start\-cli\-server\-registries\-list(1)
List connected registries and their names
.TP
start\-cli\-server\-registries\-remove(1)
Disconnect a registry, including the Start9 and Community registries
.TP
start\-cli\-server\-registries\-set\-os(1)
Use a connected registry for StartOS updates
